        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"40f694f2-a951-4611-b6dc-7a14e2500a9f\",\"review_text\":\"Wonder app for any mood you are in and it got free play and and first place play that real reasonable price\"},{\"review_id\":\"c9b93bd7-bb30-44a8-a755-8a4728f84c44\",\"review_text\":\"Premium is expensive, but it's good otherwise.\"},{\"review_id\":\"da632655-58d7-4bea-82c1-56a032fb910d\",\"review_text\":\"Very hate full very bad app and I recommend can not download this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"79f5daa8-af9e-40e8-8517-5423a4d51155\",\"review_text\":\"I hate 😒 this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"b54445d1-58ec-4034-9c03-0a381cd6f5a1\",\"review_text\":\"Corporate greed at it's best\"},{\"review_id\":\"03644631-d311-41f4-9d3c-7c829a1aa2b3\",\"review_text\":\"Whenever I open the app and play the song which is paused in before session or when I used the app Last time then the current song plays and then it stops the flow and doesn't continue to next song even though when I press next button. It's the worst thing it has got in the update.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b7178947-7b74-427b-9684-e5c442ca3fdf\",\"review_text\":\"Why Spotify why you do it you ware best at a time but now I feel you don't need people you just need money.\"},{\"review_id\":\"1afa0521-fedb-4158-b8c9-0b1bf26941ad\",\"review_text\":\"Why some songs are not available\"},{\"review_id\":\"25144d38-9bd2-45ec-a4c9-2f34371f7b5e\",\"review_text\":\"Nice app but I can't set ringtone\"},{\"review_id\":\"0e63d1bf-bf5a-4cfe-bc54-eef5bfc3e920\",\"review_text\":\"The best app music\"}]}"
